{"type":"text","timestamp":1794546340117,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c2a8ffeJgvonzMMJV44b8","part":{"id":"prt_1d34c0060002ilrElTHsKL1Tjb","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c2a8ffeJgvonzMMJV44b8","messageID":"msg_1d34bd616001Yavdm4IvXfTFFi","type":"text","text":"T013 implemented. Two files written, and the second verify leg passes. The first verify leg fails only on the declaration freshness test, which T020 owns.\n\n**Files written**\n\n1. `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs`: `loadSession` now returns `injected` when the reader supplies an array, and keeps the old shape otherwise. `readSession` is untouched.\n2. `.skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/injected-text.test.mjs`: added one case, `loadSession carries the Pi custom message while readSession leaves it out`. It loads a Pi fixture with a `custom_message` through `loadSession` and asserts `injected` is `[{ source: 'session-start-context', text: BRIEF }]`, then loads the same session through `readSession` and asserts `pi-context` is absent.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`VSR` (`node --test .skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/*.test.mjs`), exit 1:\n\n```\nℹ tests 90\nℹ pass 89\nℹ fail 1\n✖ failing tests:\ntest at .skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/declarations.test.mjs:16:1\n  STALE claude.d.mts\n  STALE claude.d.mts.map\n  STALE devin.d.mts\n  STALE devin.d.mts.map\n  STALE dsh.d.mts\n  STALE dsh.d.mts.map\n  STALE index.d.mts.map\n  STALE pi.d.mts\n  STALE pi.d.mts.map\n  STATUS=STALE session-reader-declarations: 9 file(s); run node .skilled/hooks/shared/session-reader-declarations.mjs\n  1 !== 0\n```\n\nThe focused file passes, exit 0:\n\n```\n✔ loadSession carries the Pi custom message while readSession leaves it out (1.775542ms)\nℹ tests 6\nℹ pass 6\nℹ fail 0\n```\n\nThe second leg prints `ok,code`.\n\n**What I could not do**\n\n`VSR` cannot report `fail 0` while the wave's reader edits are uncommitted. Eight of the nine stale declarations belong to `claude.mjs`, `devin.mjs`, `dsh.mjs` and `pi.mjs`, which other workers changed and I did not touch. The ninth is `index.d.mts.map`, staled by my source change. `tasks.md` T020 (wave 3) names `SRD` as the sole regeneration step and says \"do not edit a declaration by hand\", so I did not run it, and T013 does not name a declaration file. No checkbox was ticked, no commit was made, and no other file was touched.","time":{"start":1794546335840,"end":1794546340117}}}
